      "message_parsed": "<a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/members/6879/\">Moroz</a> задача выполняется, но в логах такая ошибко:<br />\n<br />\n<code style=\"font-family: Monaco, 'Andale Mono', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\nfont-size: 0.9em;\nfont-style: normal;\nline-height: 1.3em;\nbackground: #BFE6FF;\nborder: 1px solid #C6C6EA;\nborder-radius: 3.5px;\npadding: 1px 3px;\ncolor: #0F4D79;\ndisplay: inline-block;\nmargin-bottom: 2px;\">[14-Dec-2016 09:29:17 Europe/Moscow] PHP Warning:  mysql_fetch_assoc(): 32 is not a valid MySQL result resource in /var/www/....../data/www/......./includes/db/mysql.php on line 252</code>",
